<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<LanguageData>
  <!-- EN: Weazel single-use clone vat -->
  <Weazel_CloneVat.label>鼬族一次性复制培养槽</Weazel_CloneVat.label>
  <!-- EN: A single-use clone vat that can duplicate one Weazel. Use 'Start Weazel clone incubation' to choose a Weazel colonist and fill it with 20 Purified Essence and 5 nutrition; 5 days later, an identical Weazel emerges and joins the colony. Implants are not copied. The device is destroyed by the overload once incubation ends.\n\nCloning is a grave matter in Weazel society. A Weazel's absolute caste is measured by how close it is to the original, so every new round of cloning means the birth of a new, lower caste. Weazels keep this hierarchy by grouping all clones born in the same cycle into the same caste. Normally, cloning only takes place at the 'Factory', the facility every Weazel regards as home.\n\nYet sometimes many capable Weazels are needed at once. Weazel command acknowledges this, and rewards high-performing raiding parties with simplified, single-use cloning devices. Weazels grown this way are nearly identical to the original in every respect, so they customarily inherit the original's rank and name. -->
  <Weazel_CloneVat.description>能复制一名鼬族的一次性复制培养槽。使用“开始培养鼬族复制体”选择一名鼬族殖民者，并装入20个纯化精华与5营养值；5天后，一名一模一样的鼬族就会出槽并加入殖民地。植入物不会被复制。培养结束时，装置会因过载而毁损。\n\n在鼬族社会中，复制是一件大事。鼬族的绝对阶级取决于与原型的接近程度，因此每一轮新的复制，都代表一个更低阶级的诞生。鼬族把同一周期诞生的复制体全归入同一阶级，借此维持这套阶层制度。通常，复制只会在“工厂”进行，那是所有鼬族都视为故乡的设施。\n\n然而，有时会一次需要许多能干的鼬族。鼬族指挥部也承认这点，于是把简化过的一次性复制装置赏给表现优异的掠夺队。以这种方式培养出的鼬族在各方面几乎与原型无异，因此按惯例会继承原型的阶级与名字。</Weazel_CloneVat.description>
</LanguageData>
